{"baseRefName":"docs/seo-social-cards-jsonld","baseRefOid":"6b6414dcabcac8e4c78b02fa041f1706e5f0295e","body":"## Summary\n\nRedesigns the home page sections, adds the maintainer's other projects, and makes the desktop nav shrink on scroll. Stacked on #536.\n\n- **Bento** replaces the four-row \"Everything stays one keystroke away\" list: two tile sizes, each showing a small piece of what it describes (the four modes, the real provider count and names, history/calendar/recommendations/downloads, and the `/recover` → `/fallback` → `/diagnostics` order). Server-rendered, no client JS.\n- **Open source** replaces the single support strip: free ways to help first, the maintainer credited, and the Sponsors panel with its honest empty wall. Sponsorship is offered once per view.\n- **Workshop** section and the footer's \"Also by KitsuneKode\" column read one curated list (Arche, sweep, kittymux, run-cli, JS Questions Lab, yt-playlist-dedupe). Each card has the project's own one-liner, language, last-updated date and stars once they reach 5. Facts come from a cached GitHub lookup (1 h, optional token) that falls back to the curated copy and **rejects forks**. No third-party images are loaded.\n- **Nav** shrinks on scroll via a `transform: scale()` toggled by an `IntersectionObserver` sentinel: no scroll listener, nothing animates width or padding.\n\n`portless` is removed from the footer: GitHub reports it as a fork, and the list is originals only. A test pins that.\n\n## Needs a maintainer decision\n\n- The workshop list (`apps/docs/lib/workshop.ts`) is hand-curated copy. Please check the one-liners and which projects belong on the home page.\n- Contributors are deliberately not shown as a wall: there is one human contributor, so a gallery would overstate it.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `bun run typecheck`, `lint`, `fmt:check`, `test` in `apps/docs` (397 pass)\n- [x] `bun run build`\n- [x] Real-browser pass at 1440 px: bento, open-source, workshop and footer render; nav shrinks on scroll\n- [ ] Phone-width pass (not repeated after this change)\n- [ ] Nav shrink on a real trackpad/touch device\n","files":[{"path":"apps/docs/app/(home)/home-page-shell.tsx","additions":27,"deletions":16,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/docs/app/layout.tsx","additions":2,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/docs/app/styles/docs-chrome.css","additions":19,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/docs/app/styles/home.css","additions":8,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/docs/components/home/home-bento.tsx","additions":171,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/docs/components/home/home-open-source.tsx","additions":160,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/docs/components/home/home-support-strip.tsx","additions":0,"deletions":47,"changeType":"DELETED"},{"path":"apps/docs/components/home/workshop-showcase.tsx","additions":126,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/docs/components/layout/nav-compact.tsx","additions":50,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/docs/components/layout/site-footer.tsx","additions":19,"deletions":28,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/docs/components/support/sponsor-wall.tsx","additions":24,"deletions":11,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/docs/lib/github-repos.ts","additions":72,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/docs/lib/nav-compact.ts","additions":22,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/docs/lib/workshop.ts","additions":124,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/docs/test/home-sections.test.tsx","additions":140,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/docs/test/site-footer.test.tsx","additions":2,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/docs/test/support.test.tsx","additions":5,"deletions":5,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/docs/test/workshop.test.ts","additions":88,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"}],"headRefName":"docs/home-redesign-workshop","headRefOid":"356792b